  "visual": {
    "visualType": "textbox",
    "objects": {
      "general": [
        {
          "properties": {
            "paragraphs": [
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "What it is.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "'Inter Medium', 'Inter SemiBold', 'Segoe UI Semibold', wf_segoe-ui_semibold, helvetica, arial, sans-serif",
                      "fontSize": "8pt",
                      "color": "#1F2328"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": " New York State’s projection of jobs to fill each year, averaged over 2022–2032: new jobs, plus jobs left by people who retire or change careers.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Inter, 'Segoe UI', wf_segoe-ui_normal, helvetica, arial, sans-serif",
                      "fontSize": "8pt",
                      "color": "#5B6470"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": " ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Inter, 'Segoe UI', wf_segoe-ui_normal, helvetica, arial, sans-serif",
                      "fontSize": "4pt",
                      "color": "#5B6470"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "What it leaves out.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "'Inter Medium', 'Inter SemiBold', 'Segoe UI Semibold', wf_segoe-ui_semibold, helvetica, arial, sans-serif",
                      "fontSize": "8pt",
                      "color": "#1F2328"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": " A move to the same kind of job at another employer isn’t an opening, so actual hiring is higher.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Inter, 'Segoe UI', wf_segoe-ui_normal, helvetica, arial, sans-serif",
                      "fontSize": "8pt",
                      "color": "#5B6470"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": " ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Inter, 'Segoe UI', wf_segoe-ui_normal, helvetica, arial, sans-serif",
                      "fontSize": "4pt",
                      "color": "#5B6470"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "How far off it can be.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "'Inter Medium', 'Inter SemiBold', 'Segoe UI Semibold', wf_segoe-ui_semibold, helvetica, arial, sans-serif",
                      "fontSize": "8pt",
                      "color": "#1F2328"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": " A 2026 check of 36 states’ 2014–2024 forecasts, New York’s included, found a job’s 10-year growth missed by about 28 points on average (Federal Reserve Bank of Cleveland). So we round: “about 640”, not “642”.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Inter, 'Segoe UI', wf_segoe-ui_normal, helvetica, arial, sans-serif",
                      "fontSize": "8pt",
                      "color": "#5B6470"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": " ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Inter, 'Segoe UI', wf_segoe-ui_normal, helvetica, arial, sans-serif",
                      "fontSize": "4pt",
                      "color": "#5B6470"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Filled-in jobs.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "'Inter Medium', 'Inter SemiBold', 'Segoe UI Semibold', wf_segoe-ui_semibold, helvetica, arial, sans-serif",
                      "fontSize": "8pt",
                      "color": "#1F2328"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": " For 18 of the 164 ranked jobs the state published only a group total; we split it, and they say “our estimate”.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Inter, 'Segoe UI', wf_segoe-ui_normal, helvetica, arial, sans-serif",
                      "fontSize": "8pt",
                      "color": "#5B6470"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
